{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜表行職員︰鄺港智賣表錢落蔡天鳳帳戶　辯方稱曾有600萬入張燕花戶口</strong></p><p>・表行職員指賣款<br>・款項存入蔡天鳳帳戶<br>・辯方稱曾有六百萬<br>・款項轉入張燕花戶口</p><p>暫時未能從Now 新聞擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.now.com/home/local/player?newsId=666718\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:42.601592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T03:36:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.638505+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.638505+00:00","content_hash":"236febc476b30bb0168710ce004070ea3e66765b12a13918ecb6d89ad69db40b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}